#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:124
msgid "To make an inventory adjustment, and assign a lot number, go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Operations --> Physical Inventory`. Then, click :guilabel:`New`."
