#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:127
msgid "In the new inventory adjustment line that appears, set the :guilabel:`Product`, create the :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number`, set the :guilabel:`Counted Quantity`, and click :icon:`fa-floppy-o` :guilabel:`Apply`."
