msgstr "Añada una :guilabel:`Descripción` para este lote."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods/batch.rst:149 ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods/cluster.rst:154
msgid "The :guilabel:`Description` field can be used to add additional information to help workers identify the source of the batch, where to place the batch, what shipping containers to use, etc."
msgstr "El campo :guilabel:`Descripción` se puede utilizar para añadir información adicional que ayude a los trabajadores a identificar el origen del lote, dónde colocarlo, qué contenedores de envío utilizar, etc."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods/batch.rst:152
