msgid ":doc:`multipack`"
msgstr ":doc:`multipack`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:3
msgid "Dispatch management system"
msgstr "Sistema de gestión de expedición"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:5
msgid "The *dispatch management system* feature in Odoo is used to plan and build shipments. Key features include:"
msgstr "La función *sistema de gestión de despachos* de Odoo se utiliza para planificar y organizar los envíos. Las funciones clave incluyen:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:8
msgid "**Load building**: Group products for specific carriers, assign those :doc:`batches <../picking_methods/batch>` to loading docks, and manage vehicle assignments based on fleet capacity. This ensures the right products are packed into the appropriate trucks for delivery."
msgstr "**Organización de cargas**: agrupe productos para transportistas específicos, asigne esos :doc:`lotes <../picking_methods/batch>` a los muelles de carga y gestione las asignaciones de vehículos según la capacidad de la flota. Esto garantiza que los productos correctos se empaqueten en los camiones adecuados para su entrega."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:11
msgid ":doc:`Fleet management <../../../../hr/fleet>`: Track and manage the capacity of in-house delivery vehicles."
msgstr ":doc:`Gestión de flota <../../../../hr/fleet>`: haga un seguimiento y gestione la capacidad de los vehículos de entrega propios."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:17
msgid "To use the dispatch management system, the following setup must be completed:"
msgstr "Para utilizar el sistema de gestión de despachos, se debe completar la siguiente configuración:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:19
msgid ":ref:`Install <general/install>` the **Fleet** application."
msgstr ":ref:`Instale <general/install>` la aplicación **Flota**."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:20
msgid "Configure vehicle :ref:`capacity (volume and weight) <inventory/shipping_receiving/vehicle-capacity>`."
msgstr "Configure la :ref:`capacidad del vehículo (volumen y peso) <inventory/shipping_receiving/vehicle-capacity>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:22
msgid "Enter vehicle :doc:`car model(s) <../../../../hr/fleet/models>`."
msgstr "Introduzca el o los :doc:`modelos de vehículo <../../../../hr/fleet/models>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:23
msgid "Enable :ref:`necessary features <inventory/shipping_receiving/inventory-features>` in the **Inventory** app."
msgstr "Habilite las :ref:`funciones necesarias <inventory/shipping_receiving/inventory-features>` en la aplicación **Inventario**."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:25
msgid "Set up :ref:`vehicles as delivery methods <inventory/shipping_receiving/delivery-method-for-carrier>`."
msgstr "Configure los :ref:`vehículos como métodos de entrega <inventory/shipping_receiving/delivery-method-for-carrier>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:27
msgid "Create :ref:`dock locations <inventory/shipping_receiving/docks>`."
msgstr "Cree :ref:`ubicaciones de muelle <inventory/shipping_receiving/docks>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:32
msgid "Vehicle capacity"
msgstr "Capacidad del vehículo"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:34
msgid "To configure the vehicle capacity, go to :menuselection:`Fleet app --> Configuration --> Categories`."
msgstr "Para configurar la capacidad del vehículo, vaya a :menuselection:`Flota --> Configuración --> Categorías`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:37
msgid "Next, click :guilabel:`New` to add a new category, or click into an existing category to modify it. In the :guilabel:`Name` field, enter the type of vehicle (e.g., `Pick-up truck`, `Van`, or `Cargo truck`). Then, enter the vehicle capacity in the :guilabel:`Max Weight` (in kilograms) and :guilabel:`Max Volume` (in cubic meters) fields."
msgstr "A continuación, haga clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo` para añadir una categoría nueva, o haga clic en una categoría existente para modificarla. En el campo :guilabel:`Nombre`, introduzca el tipo de vehículo (por ejemplo, `Camioneta`, `Furgoneta` o `Camión de carga`). Después, introduzca la capacidad del vehículo en los campos :guilabel:`Peso máximo` (en kilogramos) y :guilabel:`Volumen máximo` (en metros cúbicos)."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:51
msgid "The units of measurement for vehicle capacity are assigned at the global level in the **Settings** app, in the :guilabel:`Units of Measure` section."
msgstr "Las unidades de medida para la capacidad del vehículo se asignan a nivel global en la aplicación **Ajustes**, en la sección :guilabel:`Unidades de medida`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:62
msgid ":ref:`Vehicle category <fleet/categories>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Categoría de vehículo <fleet/categories>`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:66
msgid "Car model"
msgstr "Modelo de vehículo"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:68
msgid "Configuring a vehicle's car model is required when adding vehicles in Odoo. Ensure the correct *Category* is selected for a car model. Doing so automatically applies weight and volume capacities to all vehicles of that type."
msgstr "Es necesario configurar el modelo de vehículo al añadir vehículos en Odoo. Asegúrese de seleccionar la *categoría* correcta para un modelo de vehículo. Al hacerlo, se aplican automáticamente las capacidades de peso y volumen a todos los vehículos de ese tipo."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:72
msgid "To configure, navigate to :menuselection:`Fleet app --> Configuration --> Models`."
msgstr "Para configurarlo, vaya a :menuselection:`Flota --> Configuración --> Modelos`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:74
msgid "From the :guilabel:`Models` list, select an existing model, or click :guilabel:`New` in the top-left corner to create a new model. Then, set the relevant :guilabel:`Category` field to the relevant vehicle category."
msgstr "En la lista :guilabel:`Modelos`, seleccione un modelo existente o haga clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo` en la esquina superior izquierda para crear un modelo nuevo. Después, establezca el campo :guilabel:`Categoría` correspondiente con la categoría de vehículo pertinente."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:79
msgid ":doc:`Create car model <../../../../hr/fleet/models>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Crear un modelo de vehículo <../../../../hr/fleet/models>`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:85
msgid "Inventory settings"
msgstr "Ajustes de Inventario"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:87
msgid "Next, go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Settings`, and enable the required features for dispatch management."
msgstr "A continuación, vaya a :menuselection:`Inventario --> Configuración --> Ajustes` y habilite las funciones necesarias para la gestión de despachos."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:90
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Operations` section, tick the :guilabel:`Batch, Wave & Cluster Transfers` checkbox to prepare batches of orders for delivery."
msgstr "En la sección :guilabel:`Operaciones`, marque la casilla :guilabel:`Transferencias por lotes, oleadas y clústeres` para preparar lotes de pedidos para su entrega."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:93
