msgid ":doc:`../delivery_status_and_dates`"
msgstr ":doc:`../delivery_status_and_dates`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/foxpost.rst:27 ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/gls.rst:24 ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/mpl.rst:20
msgid ":doc:`../payment_gated_delivery`"
msgstr ":doc:`../payment_gated_delivery`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/foxpost.rst:34
msgid "The connector talks to the Foxpost *web API*, which requires three credentials issued by Foxpost under the company's carrier contract: an API user, an API password, and an API key. Foxpost operates a separate **test** system and **production** system, so request access to both from Foxpost: the test system allows the full flow (parcel registration, labels, tracking) to be rehearsed without real parcels being created in the production network."
msgstr "El conector se comunica con la *API web* de Foxpost, que requiere tres credenciales emitidas por Foxpost en virtud del contrato de transportista de la empresa: un usuario de API, una contraseña de API y una clave de API. Foxpost opera un sistema de **pruebas** y un sistema de **producción** independientes, por lo que conviene solicitar acceso a ambos a Foxpost: el sistema de pruebas permite ensayar el flujo completo (registro de paquetes, etiquetas, seguimiento) sin crear paquetes reales en la red de producción."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/foxpost.rst:41
msgid "Credentials are environment-specific: use each set only against the environment it was issued for. Which environment Odoo calls is decided per shipping method by its :guilabel:`Environment` button (see below) — always double-check that the credentials entered on the method match the selected environment."
msgstr "Las credenciales son específicas de cada entorno: utilice cada conjunto solo con el entorno para el que se emitió. El entorno al que llama Odoo se decide por método de envío mediante su botón :guilabel:`Entorno` (véase más abajo) — compruebe siempre que las credenciales introducidas en el método coincidan con el entorno seleccionado."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/foxpost.rst:51
msgid "Installing the module creates two ready-made shipping methods: *Foxpost Parcelmachine* (parcel machine mode) and *Foxpost Home delivery* (home delivery mode). Both install **unpublished**, with a zero price and empty credentials — they are templates to complete rather than working methods."
msgstr "Al instalar el módulo se crean dos métodos de envío ya preparados: *Foxpost Parcelmachine* (modo máquina de paquetería) y *Foxpost Home delivery* (modo entrega a domicilio). Ambos se instalan **sin publicar**, con precio cero y credenciales vacías — son plantillas por completar y no métodos operativos."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/foxpost.rst:55
msgid "To configure them (or to create additional ones), go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Delivery Methods` and open the method. Selecting :guilabel:`Foxpost` in the :guilabel:`Provider` field reveals two Foxpost-specific tabs on the form: :guilabel:`Foxpost Configuration` and :guilabel:`Pricing`."
msgstr "Para configurarlos (o crear otros adicionales), vaya a :menuselection:`Aplicación de Inventario --> Configuración --> Métodos de entrega` y abra el método. Al seleccionar :guilabel:`Foxpost` en el campo :guilabel:`Proveedor` aparecen dos pestañas específicas de Foxpost en el formulario: :guilabel:`Configuración de Foxpost` y :guilabel:`Tarifas`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/foxpost.rst:60
msgid "For the fields shared by every third-party carrier, such as :guilabel:`Delivery Product` or :guilabel:`Countries`, refer to the :doc:`third-party carrier <third_party_shipper>` documentation."
msgstr "Para conocer los campos comunes a todos los transportistas de terceros, como :guilabel:`Producto de entrega` o :guilabel:`Países`, consulte la documentación sobre :doc:`transportistas de terceros <third_party_shipper>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/foxpost.rst:64
msgid "To have Odoo register parcels and fetch labels, keep the :guilabel:`Integration Level` at :guilabel:`Get Rate and Create Shipment`. With :guilabel:`Get Rate`, the method only computes prices at checkout and never contacts Foxpost at shipping time."
msgstr "Para que Odoo registre los paquetes y obtenga las etiquetas, mantenga el :guilabel:`Nivel de integración` en :guilabel:`Obtener tarifa y crear envío`. Con :guilabel:`Obtener tarifa`, el método solo calcula los precios en el proceso de compra y nunca contacta con Foxpost en el momento del envío."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/foxpost.rst:77 ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/gls.rst:66 ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/mpl.rst:70
msgid "Credentials"
msgstr "Credenciales"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/foxpost.rst:79
msgid "On the :guilabel:`Foxpost Configuration` tab, fill in the three credentials from the :ref:`account setup <inventory/shipping_receiving/foxpost-account>`:"
msgstr "En la pestaña :guilabel:`Configuración de Foxpost`, introduzca las tres credenciales obtenidas en la :ref:`configuración de la cuenta <inventory/shipping_receiving/foxpost-account>`:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/foxpost.rst:82
msgid ":guilabel:`API User` and :guilabel:`API Password`: the HTTP authentication pair for the Foxpost web API."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Usuario de API` y :guilabel:`Contraseña de API`: el par de autenticación HTTP para la API web de Foxpost."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/foxpost.rst:84
msgid ":guilabel:`API Key`: the additional key Foxpost requires on every API call."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Clave de API`: la clave adicional que Foxpost exige en cada llamada a la API."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/foxpost.rst:86
msgid "These fields — together with the :guilabel:`Delivery type` field described below — are only visible to users in the *Administration / Settings* group; other users see the shipping method form without them."
msgstr "Estos campos — junto con el campo :guilabel:`Tipo de entrega` descrito más abajo — solo son visibles para los usuarios del grupo *Administración / Ajustes*; el resto de usuarios ven el formulario del método de envío sin ellos."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/foxpost.rst:90
msgid "The :guilabel:`Environment` smart button in the top-right corner of the form toggles between :guilabel:`Test Environment` and :guilabel:`Production Environment`. In test mode, every call goes to Foxpost's test API; switch the method to production once the flow has been verified end to end."
msgstr "El botón inteligente :guilabel:`Entorno`, en la esquina superior derecha del formulario, alterna entre :guilabel:`Entorno de pruebas` y :guilabel:`Entorno de producción`. En el modo de pruebas, todas las llamadas se dirigen a la API de pruebas de Foxpost; cambie el método a producción una vez que se haya verificado el flujo de principio a fin."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/foxpost.rst:95 ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/gls.rst:87 ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/mpl.rst:89
msgid "Delivery types"
msgstr "Tipos de entrega"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/foxpost.rst:97
msgid "The :guilabel:`Delivery type` field on the :guilabel:`Foxpost Configuration` tab selects one of two operating modes. A single shipping method always works in exactly one mode; to offer both, publish two methods (which is what the two preinstalled records provide)."
msgstr "El campo :guilabel:`Tipo de entrega` de la pestaña :guilabel:`Configuración de Foxpost` selecciona uno de los dos modos de funcionamiento. Un mismo método de envío siempre funciona exactamente en un modo; para ofrecer ambos, publique dos métodos (que es justo lo que proporcionan los dos registros preinstalados)."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/foxpost.rst:105
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Modo"

